-- **Audio:** `AudioVolume`, `bMuted`. **Subtitles:** `bShowSubtitles` (default on), `SubtitleTextSize` (font size = video height x this, default 0.045 ~ YouTube; Margin scaled by size / 14; 0 = the Font's own size), `SubtitleFont` (default Regular 14), `SubtitleColor`, `SubtitleBackground`, `SubtitleMargin`.
+- **Audio:** `AudioVolume`, `bMuted`, `AudioSpace` (`EMediaBoxAudioSpace`: 2D (UI) - default, the old behaviour / World (On Diegetic Screen)), `WorldAudio` (`FMediaBoxWorldAudio`: Attenuation asset, else Inner Radius 300 cm, Falloff Distance 2500 cm, Occlusion on (channel Visibility, low pass 1500 Hz, volume 0.4, 0.2 s interpolation, simple collision), Reverb send on). **Subtitles:** `bShowSubtitles` (default on), `SubtitleTextSize` (font size = video height x this, default 0.045 ~ YouTube; Margin scaled by size / 14; 0 = the Font's own size), `SubtitleFont` (default Regular 14), `SubtitleColor`, `SubtitleBackground`, `SubtitleMargin`.
 - **Events:** On Opened, On First Frame, On Looped, On Ended, On Error (Reason), On Subtitle Changed, On Status Changed. **Blueprint:** Play, Pause, Stop, Toggle Play Pause, Seek, Set Clip (bPlayNow), Get Clip, Set Hover Target, Set Playback Rate, Set Volume, Set Muted, Get Status, Is Playing, Get Time, Get Duration, Get Progress, Get Current Subtitle, Get Media Player / Get Media Texture (pooled - not to keep).
 - **Ticking:** registers with its pool in `RebuildWidget`, leaves (and gives back its lease, leaves its group) in `ReleaseSlateResources` (not while unreachable); the pool ticks it (`TickMediaBox`) before rebalancing.
